Error: Only 1 argument allowed, but 2 were passed.
  ,
2 | a {b: alpha(opacity=50, string.unquote(""))}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:7  root stylesheet
<===> error/multiple_empty/error-libsass
Error: Only 1 argument allowed, but 2 were passed.
  ,
2 | a {b: alpha(opacity=50, string.unquote(""))}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:7  alpha()
  ,
2 | a {b: alpha(opacity=50, string.unquote(""))}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:7  root stylesheet
